  <prompt>Add a lean `Email` variant to the closed `WorkspaceTabVisibleState` union and emit it via `TryDeriveVisibleState` / `FormatVisibleStateFields`.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. .NET 8 Minimal API + AI agent-factory expertise; comfortable extending closed sealed-record unions and their derive/format switch cases while preserving structural deserialization.</role>
  <goal>The union deserializes the Email shape structurally (no fallback to Dashboard/Summary); the server emits the Email fields in the agent prompt.</goal>
  <context>
    <background>FR-C2 server half. The server `WorkspaceTabVisibleState` union has 4 variants at :41-94. `TryDeriveVisibleState` (SprkChatAgentFactory.cs:1547-1592) derives the visible state and `FormatVisibleStateFields` (:1679-1717) emits its fields into the agent prompt. Email has no honest fit among the 4 variants and must be added, kept closed, and 1:1 with the client discriminator (040).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Models/Workspace/WorkspaceTabVisibleState.cs (:41-94 variants)</file>
